luating core competencies.", "questions": [{"question_number": 1, "question_text": "The ratio between the total expenditure on Taxes for all the years and the total expenditure on Fuel and Transport for all the years respectively is approximately?", "option_a": "4:7", "option_b": "10:13", "option_c": "15:18", "option_d": "5:8", "correct_option": "B"}, {"question_number": 2, "question_text": "The total expenditure of the company over these items during the year 2000 is?", "option_a": "Rs. 544.44 lakhs", "option_b": "Rs. 501.11 lakhs", "option_c": "Rs. 446.46 lakhs", "option_d": "Rs. 478.87 lakhs", "correct_option": "A"}, {"question_number": 3, "question_text": "What is the average amount of interest per year which the company had to pay during this period?", "option_a": "Rs. 32.43 lakhs", "option_b": "Rs. 33.72 lakhs", "option_c": "Rs. 34.18 lakhs", "option_d": "Rs. 36.66 lakhs", "correct_option": "D"}, {"question_number": 4, "question_text": "Total expenditure on all these items in 1998 was approximately what percent of the total expenditure in 2002?", "option_a": "62%", "option_b": "66%", "option_c": "69%", "option_d": "71%", "correct_option": "C"}, {"question_number": 5, "question_text": "The total amount of bonus paid by the company during the given period is approximately what percent of the total amount of salary paid during this period?", "option_a": "0.1%", "option_b": "Sales of Books (in thousand numbers) from Six Branches - B1, B2, B3, B4, B5 and B6 of", "option_c": "1%", "option_d": "1.25%", "correct_option": "C"}, {"question_number": 6, "question_text": "Total sales of branches B1, B3 and B5 together for both the years (in thousand numbers) is?", "option_a": "250", "option_b": "310", "option_c": "435", "option_d": "560", "correct_option": "D"}, {"question_number": 7, "question_text": "Total sales of branch B6 for both the years is what percent of the total sales of branches B3 for both the years?", "option_a": "68.54%", "option_b": "71.11%", "option_c": "